# Allowlist: the build context contains only what the API image needs.
# Datasets (data/), model artifacts (models/, *.joblib), reports, notebooks,
# the virtual environment, and Git metadata never enter the build context.
# The model is mounted read-only when the container runs; see README 14.2.
*
!requirements-api.txt
!src/api.py
!src/predict.py

# Defense in depth: never send data or model files, even if allowlisted above.
**/*.joblib
**/*.pkl
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
data/
models/
**/__pycache__/
